<title>TURKEY: Turkey's Esbank signs $57-million syndicated loan.</title>
<headline>Turkey's Esbank signs $57-million syndicated loan.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's private Esbank signed an accord on Monday for a $57-million syndicated loan from a consortium, led by Fuji Bank and ING Bank, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the accord for the one-year loan was signed in London.</p>
<p>It did not disclose any further details.</p>
</text>
